e and e-banking will soon be available to you once again as usual. <br> <br> If you need to deal with anything urgently, simply call us on +423 235 66 55 or send us an e-mail to <a href="mailto:info@vpbank.com">info@vpbank.com</a>. Need to block your debit card? You can receive assistance on +423 235 70 00. </p> </div> </div> </section> <footer class="site-footer"> <div class="site-footer-inner"> <div class="site-footer-left"> <p class="language-target" data-lang-target="de" style="color: var(--vpb-color-text-primary)"> © VP Bank AG - alle Rechte vorbehalten </p> <p class="language-target" data-lang-target="en" style="color: var(--vpb-color-text-primary)"> © VP Bank Ltd - all rights reserved. </p> </div> <div class="site-footer-right"> <nav class="nav-language lined-collection -bold -top -separated" data-language-switcher=""> <a href="#" class="item -active text-2xs-regular" data-lang="de">DE</a> <vpb-icon style="color:#4C6573" src="path.svg"></vpb-icon> <a href="#" class="item text-2xs-regular" data-lang="en">EN</a> </nav> </div> </div> </footer> <script> /**
